e  agencies were zeroing in on Martin  Luther King and we know the two of them  were there at the crime scene and if the  CIA wasn't joining the trilogy I would  be very very surprised so so they may  hold the key to the truth of this matter  more than any of the witnesses when King  repudiated the Vietnam War do you think  that may have tipped the scale I by the  memos it definitely tipped the scale it  went from a worrisome situation of  racial animosity hatred and Prejudice  and fear about economic politics and  racial politics to a major national  security issue and that up the ante  tremendously  any other questions follow us all right  if not thank you very much we appreciate  it we have people here have additional  information about the conference if you  would like it so feel free to ask
 

